=== 5. LOG-LINEAR POWER-LAW FIT OF EXPONENTS IN n AND S ===
Blocked LRU (n=64..512, S=48..3072, 16 pts): IO = 6.592 * n^2.9996 * S^-0.4930  (R^2=0.999995)
Blocked LRU (n=64..256, S=48..3072, 12 pts): IO = 6.598 * n^2.9995 * S^-0.4931  (R^2=0.999991)
Blocked OPT (n=64..256, S=48..3072, 12 pts): IO = 4.230 * n^2.9396 * S^-0.4728  (R^2=0.999813)
